# Missions: a go step (Clarion Alley, within 25 m), then a trick step on a gap done twice (CLARION
# WALLRIDE, as sf-clarion-wallride rides it), with Marisol's barks: as it starts (say), between
# (each: again, but with feeling) and when done.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 mission start ch2 1
cmd 0 teleport -26.94 -395.92 1.78 84.25
hold up 6..90
hold ollie 80..100
tap grind 104
cmd 400 teleport -26.94 -395.92 1.78 84.25
hold up 406..490
hold ollie 480..500
tap grind 504
run 800
expect event missionStep{mission=ch2,step=1,kind=go} within 1..1
expect event missionStep{mission=ch2,step=2,kind=trick} within 1..2
expect event talk{line=ch2-04,character=marisol,bark=true} within 1..2
expect event gap{id=clarion_wallride} within 193..197
expect event talk{line=ch2-05,bark=true} within 233..238
expect event gap{id=clarion_wallride} within 593..597
expect event talk{line=ch2-06,bark=true} within 633..638
expect event missionStep{mission=ch2,step=3,kind=go} within 633..638
